{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792476660, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T06:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T06:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792476720, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T06:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 68048, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "有許多室內停車場，許多人都把車發動在車裡吹冷氣，現行好像沒有規定可管", "display_name": "中山代表 No.68,048", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T06:11:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35896, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "希望市長想想辦法\n如何加速都市更新\n真真的是太老舊了", "display_name": "士林代表 No.35,896", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T06:11:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 347, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "50年以上老舊公寓地震來時真的很危險，也已破舊漏水，很多已無法修繕。多數居民希望都更重建。但…困難…", "display_name": "北投代表 No.347", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T06:11:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13597, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "增設台北車站 1樓到搭車月台間的無障礙通道", "display_name": "中正代表 No.13,597", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T06:11:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 60478, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.60,478", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 35896, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.35,896", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 347, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.347", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"p